    ["What is the focus of the conversion and expansion stage?", "Maximising return and reaching further — conversion rate optimisation, retargeting, email automation and new segments, measured by conversion rate, average order value and lifetime value."],
    ["Why is 'this campaign will go viral' not a plan?", "Viral growth is a result, not a tactic; you can only design for shareability and advocacy through referral programmes, genuinely shareable content and an experience worth talking about."],
    ["Why must the campaign match the lifecycle stage?", "The same tactic is right or wrong depending on stage — a big positioning campaign before anyone wants the product burns money, and narrow traction tactics waste an established brand's reach."]
