      q: "NEA practice (P5/M3). A small online furniture retailer's data shows high product-page traffic, 62% basket abandonment at the delivery step, almost no reviews, and unanswered social comments. Describe how the digital marketing mix will be used in the campaign.",
      marks: 12,
